  "given_solution": "【分析】先求解\\(\\frac { AD } { AB }=\\frac { 2 } { 3 },\\)再证明\\(\\vartriangle ADE\\backsim \\vartriangle ABC,\\)可得\\(\\frac { DE } { BC }=\\frac { AD } { AB }=\\frac { 2 } { 3 }.\\)\n【详解】解：\\(\\because\\) \\(\\frac { AD } { BD }\\)＝\\(\\frac { 2 } { 1 }\\)，\n\\(\\therefore \\frac { AD } { AB }=\\frac { 2 } { 3 },\\)\n\\(\\because\\) DE∥BC，\n\\(\\therefore \\vartriangle ADE\\backsim \\vartriangle ABC,\\)\n\\(\\therefore \\frac { DE } { BC }=\\frac { AD } { AB }=\\frac { 2 } { 3 },\\)\n故选D\n【点睛】本题考查的是相似三角形的判定与性质，证明\\(\\vartriangle ADE\\backsim \\vartriangle ABC\\)是解本题的关键．",
